msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Она и Жизель должны быть там."

#: search2:search2_86126E8C_87B5_48EE_8C24_03057F9C1CC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08786179eff919c5a1aae4efb0a8acc7f778379ca7460a5454aae0a9c9b97d22
